WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:05.030
You are doing better,

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.240
but you shouldn't push yourself.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.090
Yeah. I'm feeling a lot better.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.220
That looks good. What is it?

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:11.420
Be grateful!

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.480
Bouillabaisse-style hot pot.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.880
It'll shrivel up if you do it daily.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.070
This is pretty good, these crab 
and shellfish corpses.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.620
It's "crabinalism"!

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.550
So, where is your homeland 
and what's it like?

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.560
I will tell you! Elfhelm!

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.970
A utopia that lies on the Western Sea.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.880
Flowers are always blooming, et cetera.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.190
El... Elf Hell?

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.460
Not "hell"!

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.910
Elfhelm.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.510
It's filled with beings like you, right?

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.330
I have heard of it from my teacher.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.270
It is a legendary island to the 
west, known as Skellig.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:00.330
Like the forest of the spirit tree, 
it belongs to the interstice,

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:04.340
so it isn't on any sea charts, 
and normal people cannot reach it.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.340
In addition to the elves, 
many mages are said to live there.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:12.280
I have always wanted to see it!

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.320
Um, Schierke?

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.790
I have a request.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.360
Would you teach me magic?

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:25.360
How about that?

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:28.410
Farnese, you want to be a witch?

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.700
W-Wait a second...

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:35.770
Ever since the trolls, I have 
been thinking about it.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:40.980
But you're an adult. You can't be 
an apprentice to this wimpy kid.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:43.650
To be honest, I was astonished then.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.800
The miracles, the divine power 
called "magic" that you used...

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:51.620
When the time came that even one
such as I had to protect someone,

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:54.800
what lent me courage to do so were Casca

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.420
and the magic dagger you gave me.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:02.180
But that's just a silver knife.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.540
To me, it was undoubtedly 
a magic dagger!

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:12.010
Flora told me to accept 
the great mysteries

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:15.050
and seek the truth about 
everything from my world.

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:16.920
That that was the way of magic.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:21.000
If the light of a greater law can 
illuminate the darkness,

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.330
then please impart it to me!

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:29.220
Come on, this ain't a show.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:33.960
Usually, they say that you cannot 
learn magic unless you start

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.440
at a very young age.

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.570
More than anything,

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:41.730
that is because, as people age, 
they become trapped

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.970
by their knowledge of 
the physical world,

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.380
so breaking free of their 
preconceptions is harder.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:51.910
But after all the terrifying things 
you've seen, Farnese,

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.080
that isn't a concern, is it?

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:57.330
I am still training myself,

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:59.640
but I think I can teach you the basics.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.510
Thank you, Teacher!

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:03.590
T-Teacher?

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.340
Lady Farnese... A w-witch?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.340
Teacher?

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.090
Can we start with spells?

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.030
We'll start with the basics.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:16.840
<b><i>Proclaimed Omens</i></b>

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.590
Hey, Schierke, let's go back...

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:51.320
The sea's creepy at night!

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.320
Taking a walk?

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.240
It's true that this moonlight

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.000
makes it hard to sleep.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.790
Guts...

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.280
I have never seen the ocean before.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:21.000
My mistress told me that the sea is
 the gate to the spiritual world.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.060
It's beautiful and kind,

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.740
eerie and terrifying,

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:29.980
a sight that touches the hearts 
of all who see it.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:34.450
And that places like that are always 
connected to the spiritual world.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.350
Back then, all I could 
do was imagine it.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.840
But standing on the beach,

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:44.280
I understand her words 
for the first time.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.830
I've departed on a journey from 
which there is no return.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.210
You're too good a student.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.570
It may be easier for you 
to keep it all inside

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:04.430
and spend your time 
worrying about others.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.410
Th-That isn't...

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:09.380
But if you keep it inside 
all the time as a kid,

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.190
you'll end up a mess of an adult.

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:15.110
Don't worry about me!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.700
To mages,

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.640
being parted by death from 
those closest to us

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.750
has a different meaning than to you 
who live in the physical world.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:28.700
A mage places herself in both the 
physical and spiritual worlds.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.390
And so to us,

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.650
it isn't an ending, but hatching 
into a great existence.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.010
It isn't...

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:36.940
It isn't...

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.000
a sad thing...

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.410
I feel a little better.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.960
The salt air is stinging 
my eyes and nose.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:02.000
Same here, actually...

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:03.880
My whole body.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.460
I knew you were pushing 
yourself too hard!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:17.570
I see!

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:20.480
I guess you're that age, huh?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.470
But I can't believe your first 
time, it's an old guy...

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:26.030
I mean, older person...

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:30.100
But I guess he is a lot better 
than the other two.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.980
What are you talking about?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:34.610
A young girl's first love is 
for a wild older man!

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:36.810
It tickles!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.040
Lovely!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.260
Wh-What's wrong?

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.000
We have company.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:46.660
I guess you survived.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.890
I might return those words to you.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.110
Lately, I've been creating one 
debt to you after another.

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:56.630
Well, that's nothing new.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:58.360
But thank you, I guess.

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:01.440
So what do you want today?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.360
The eyes will lose color,

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.890
the tongue its sense of taste,

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.710
and fingertips will tire from shaking.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.110
These are omens.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:19.940
If you continue to fight in that armor,

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.520
then light, voice, warmth...

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:26.480
You will lose many things.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.210
No...

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.520
I don't like it...

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.250
As always, you act like 
you know everything.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.000
Thanks for the warning,

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.530
but I ain't ever letting 
that happen again.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.510
Next time, I'll master this thing 
and stay in control.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.010
That's right.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.560
I shall not let that happen.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:53.060
Thank you for what you have done for us.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:54.740
I'm sorry to ask,

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:58.780
but what was your relationship 
to my mistress?

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:07.530
Did this armor originally 
belong to you, perhaps?

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:11.010
We were friends.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.880
Just as you two are now.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:22.310
The od in that armor is like a flame 
that will never be extinguished.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:25.290
Even if you master it once,

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.600
the embers will continue to smolder.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.620
Given the chance, they will 
become raging flames.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:34.020
Even with the talisman protecting you,

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.930
you must never lower your guard.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:40.650
Not if you wish to remain human.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:42.520
Thanks for the kind tip.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:46.220
While you're being kind, can you 
tell me something else?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:48.830
Why did they...

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:52.910
Why did the Apostles attack 
the old lady's mansion?

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:56.180
The hawk now places himself

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:59.530
beyond the laws that govern 
the physical world.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:05.960
Where nothing in the human 
world can threaten him.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:10.310
It would be as if the 
character in a story

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:13.770
challenged the story's author.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:18.960
If any can challenge the hawk 
and stand a chance,

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:24.150
it is another who is placed 
outside the story, as well.

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:26.790
That's why they went after my mistress?

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:33.390
They saw a single mage as a greater 
threat than an army, 10,000 strong.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:35.460
No...

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.920
I can't accept it!

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:41.710
If you would continue your journey,

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:45.130
you will see the Apostles again, soon.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:46.520
What?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:51.890
And when that happens, 
their leader will most likely be

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:53.210
the hawk.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:55.430
Guts...

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.900
He's... coming.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.540
Guts!

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.160
To protect or to challenge?

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:13.160
You will continually ask 
your soul this question.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:18.710
That is your destiny, as a human 
who stands within the interstice.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:24.210
Lastly, I give you one hope.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:28.660
The fairyland to which you travel,

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.810
and the fairy king who waits there...

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:35.930
Their name is Hanafubuku.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:37.850
I've heard of him.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:42.500
He is a very strong fairy king, 
sung of in legend.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.020
His name appears not only in grimoires,

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:47.820
but also in poems and stories.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:52.010
That bastard didn't say a word.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.010
That was my mistake.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:58.120
That the king of Puck's home 
would be so powerful...

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:02.290
With their power, it is possible.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:07.710
Your comrade, the girl of the brand,

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:11.270
may yet regain her mind.

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.720
Is that true?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.970
I shall not repeat myself.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:17.770
She can

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.070
come back?

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:23.700
Seriously?

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.190
But do not forget.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:33.100
Your hope may not

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:37.620
always be her hope.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:46.480
Casca will...

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:48.500
Seriously?

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.570
Yes.

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:54.700
Hanafubuku is a great fairy king, 
so strong he features in legends.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.260
I think we can be certain.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:59.460
Wow, your king is amazing.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.360
Why didn't you say anything?!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.970
Don't tell me...

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.640
He didn't know?

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:08.650
That's great news, Guts.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.480
<i>Your hope may not</i>

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:16.990
<i>always be her hope.</i>

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.270
<i>Fog...</i>

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.950
Guts?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.680
What's wrong?

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:44.930
Something's coming, hiding in the fog.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.250
Is it the usual ghouls?

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.300
Sounds fun!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:51.940
Been a while since a good fight!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.330
This od is closer to

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:57.190
that of the monsters that attacked 
the mansion than of ghouls.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.510
They're coming!

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.140
What is this thing?

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:22.340
A magical life form created by 
putting a spirit into an animal,

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.550
a type of familiar.

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.600
Who made these?

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.980
This isn't good!

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.260
Ivalera!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.350
On it!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.020
Yep.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.110
Okay!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.050
It's the full moon tonight,

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.800
when the power of magic is strongest.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.490
Even if this isn't holy ground,

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:43.260
I can post talismans for the kings 
of the four cardinal points.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:46.570
Buy me a little time 
to finish the spell.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.500
Right.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.490
Farnese, please take care of Casca.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.370
Yes!

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.630
Guts, you can't fight like that...

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:01.130
It's the perfect chance to get my 
body back into fighting shape.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:09.140
But we can't exit with those 
things outside the door.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:12.520
Then let's give them a snack!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.160
Taste my power!

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:28.280
It knew what I was going to do!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.040
You just rolled right into its mouth.

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:33.040
Fine!

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.010
Okay, let's just keep it out!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:50.230
Holy shit... You're back in business.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:54.100
<i>I can feel it.</i>

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:59.070
<i>He smells blood,</i>

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:02.340
<i>waiting for a chance to be unleashed.</i>

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.280
<i>Stay focused.</i>

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.790
<i>Freeze the core of your mind.</i>

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.240
<i>Draw only a minimum of 
power from the armor.</i>

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:13.290
<i>Just limit the pain enough 
so your body can move.</i>

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:17.250
<i>I'm the one who holds the reins!</i>

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.500
It's here! It's here!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.300
Do something!

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.420
Flashy, as always!

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:37.310
When you see it at night, 
it looks like an aurora.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:39.190
<i>You're all safe, aren't you?</i>

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:44.190
<i>For now, the area around 
this shack is safe.</i>

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.460
<i>But they have physical bodies,</i>

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:50.410
<i>which means there's a limit to 
the shield's effectiveness.</i>

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:54.640
<i>There must be someone nearby 
who is controlling this horde.</i>

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:55.910
<i>If you can defeat them...</i>

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.880
<i>Where is he?</i>

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.420
<i>I'm looking now.</i>

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:02.670
Figure it out fast, Miss Witch!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.470
Wait! Wait!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.800
<i>Are you done yet?</i>

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.150
<i>Follow the flow of od.</i>

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.250
<i>I found them!</i>

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:18.980
<i>Behind the rocks on the beach.</i>

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:31.970
Okay!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.420
Now it's time to bail!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.640
Wait!

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:35.950
Not yet...

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:41.160
These are Kushans?

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.840
Fog?

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:56.350
Everyone, get out of there now!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.350
What the hell is that?

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:07.980
It's bigger than an ogre!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:10.610
Oh, shit!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.490
My shield cannot stop something so big!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.250
If I aim for the eye...

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.310
Serpico!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:28.880
I lowered my guard...

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.350
<i>The caster commanding it...</i>

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.170
<i>is at sea?</i>

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:36.260
<i>No, it's too far away!</i>

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:42.180
He's so strong.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:49.780
Guts!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:52.530
No, you can't fight more now!

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.680
He really is amazing.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:05.990
I bet he can do it, right?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.530
No.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:17.520
Watch out!

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:41.290
Wait.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.520
This time, I'll go get him!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:44.960
Come on, damn it!

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:08.370
He used it...

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:19.880
He's so strong...

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.870
But his wounds will reopen!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.880
I will bring him back!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:34.200
<i>The roar of the sea.</i>

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.120
<i>It's drawing me to the 
bottom of a deep sea.</i>

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:48.800
<i>A rumbling like an animal's roar.</i>

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:34.320
Wow...

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:36.510
According to legends,

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:41.030
Berserkers were objects of 
fear not only to enemies,

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:42.660
but to their allies, as well.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:46.490
Yeah, the way he's fighting...

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.640
That isn't all.

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:52.600
It's also because they slew 
all around them,

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.450
whether friend or foe.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:03.880
<i>Stay away!</i>

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:12.110
Murder. Destroy. Shatter.

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:06.320
<i>Stay away!</i>

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.230
<i>Stay away!</i>

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:11.660
<i>Stay...</i>

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:32.070
Y-You're kidding me...

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:34.570
Hey, are you done yet?

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:40.050
Everyone, get back!

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:48.220
What do we do?

00:22:48.440 --> 00:22:49.520
I don't know.

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:52.830
Look.

00:22:56.240 --> 00:22:57.750
Listen.

00:22:58.300 --> 00:22:59.410
<i>Light.</i>

00:23:01.180 --> 00:23:02.350
<i>The water's surface.</i>

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:04.370
Reach out your hand,

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:06.080
Guts!

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:17.790
Teacher!

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:21.040
Are you yourself again?

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:22.610
Are you all right?

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:24.800
Damn it!

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:32.230
In the end, it's just like he said.

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:38.290
If you keep it inside all the time,

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:42.240
you'll end up a mess of an adult.

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:44.850
Right?

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:49.580
You're right...

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.460
<b>It seems you're helping my comrade.
I shall join you!</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>You're a witch, right?</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>Basically pirates.</b>

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>Who cares about your stupid hat?</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>I have a place to go home to.</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:27.020
<b><i>Next Episode
City of Humans</i></b>
